          "The Company will not deny employment opportunities or retaliate against an individual for requesting a reasonable accommodation in good faith. The Company expressly prohibits any form of discipline, reprisal, intimidation, or retaliation against any individual for requesting an accommodation in good faith.",
          "Harassment",
          "The Company strives to maintain a work environment free of unlawful harassment. The Company strictly prohibits and does not tolerate any kind of unlawful harassment. Unlawful harassment under this policy includes any unwelcome physical or verbal conduct or any written, pictorial, or visual communication directed at an individual or group of individuals because of that individual’s or group’s membership in, or perceived membership in, a protected class including age 40 and over, race (including traits historically associated with race, such as hair texture and length, protective hairstyles), sex, pregnancy, childbirth and related conditions, sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, color, creed, religion, marital status, national origin, ancestry, ethnicity, citizenship, disability, military status, genetic information, or any other status protected by applicable federal, state, or local law where the conduct or communication is subjectively offensive to the individual or is objectively offensive to a reasonable individual who is a member of the same protected class.",
