          "Employees who sustain work-related injuries or illnesses should inform their supervisor immediately. No matter how minor an on-the-job injury may appear, it is important that it be reported immediately. This will enable an eligible employee to qualify for coverage as quickly as possible. Employees must also provide the Company with a health-care provider’s statement certifying their work-related injury or illness, inability to work, and expected duration of the leave.",
