          "From time to time, you may be required to come in early, work late, and/or work overtime. For the purposes of calculating overtime, the workweek begins Monday at 12:00 a.m. and ends Sunday at 11:59 p.m. The workday begins at 12:00 a.m. and ends at 11:59 p.m.",
