          "When operating requirements or other needs cannot be met during regular working hours, employees will be given the opportunity to volunteer for overtime work assignments. All overtime work must receive the supervisor's prior authorization. Due to business needs, some overtime work assignments will be mandatory. Overtime assignments will be distributed as equitably as practical to all employees qualified to perform the required work.",
