          "An attendance system will be used to track the number of days tardy, or absent without permission, for each employee. The system is intended to encourage regular, on time attendance, and to promote early notification of the employee’s manager if a personal day is needed. The consequences of absenteeism range from verbal, written to termination at the Company’s sole and absolute discretion.",
