          "Safe and healthful working conditions require that all employees arrive at work properly showered or bathed, and free from communicable disease or contagious medical conditions. All employees are required to wear a shirt, long pants, and have some type of Safety Boot when they are reporting to work. Employees are required to always maintain a professional appearance and should dress and groom themselves according to the requirements of their position. Employees will not be allowed to wear shirts that have any type of profanity, or derogatory wording, symbols, or markings. Competitor shirts and, or offensive apparel are not allowed. Office employees are exempt from safety requirements unless in the field.",
